--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: TooFarGoneMegaphoneDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Ugh, not again.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Unfortunately, this person is looking too far gone.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: They have symptoms that we haven't even fully identified yet.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The rule of thumb is if they have 5 or more symptoms, they're too far
      gone.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: SuspectCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: This means they'll turn into a mutant by tonight.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: SuspectCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: They'll become a monster and kill others.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: SuspectCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: There's only one option in that case.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: RedInk
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You know what to do. Don't fuck it up.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
